WEBVTT

00:18:29.315 --> 00:18:31.399
She recently quit her career
as a professor

00:18:31.423 --> 00:18:35.129
to become a full-time
social media influencer.

00:18:35.746 --> 00:18:37.930
Lots of people call
themselves influencers,

00:18:37.954 --> 00:18:39.845
but Lyn's version is a real job.

00:18:39.869 --> 00:18:44.273
LS: I'm also known as The Accidental Icon.

00:18:44.698 --> 00:18:48.572
AG: The Accidental Icon has more
than 700,000 followers on Instagram,

00:18:48.596 --> 00:18:50.627
and she gets paid
to run ads on her account

00:18:50.651 --> 00:18:53.144
for brands like Kate Spade,
Visa and Teva.

00:18:53.764 --> 00:18:56.112
Her feed is filled
with stylized photos of herself

00:18:56.136 --> 00:18:57.540
posing around New York City

00:18:57.564 --> 00:19:00.051
in designer clothes and large sunglasses.